  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Skatteverket, projektidentifering</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Swedish Tax Agency, PIM - Swedish Tax Administration pre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;det avser en identifieringsfas inf&#xF6;r ett eventuellt samarbete mellan Skatteverket och deras moldaviska motsvarighet, Moldova State Tax Inspectorate, d&#xE4;r rapporten fr&#xE5;n denna fas kommer att utg&#xF6;ra underlag f&#xF6;r myndighetssamarbetet. St&#xF6;det avser tv&#xE5; bes&#xF6;k i Moldavien av Skatteverket.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme consists in a Project Identification Mission which aim at preparing the inception phase of a possible future Sida funded project in Moldova and the report that emanates from the mission will be used as a basis for a project document, which will be drafted by STA and MSTI, for a project based on the cooperation between STA and MSTI. The mission will consist of 2 visits.</narrative>
  </description>
